{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1000_p", "source_sha256": "685a88532d45a00df77582b12587a03f7145afa2b09b3af78f36d359f343c1fa", "ja": "（今日はアイスの宣伝ポスター撮影……なのだが、\n舞台のセットが……うーん、これは相談かな）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄冰淇淋宣传海报……本来应该是这样，可舞台布景……嗯，这得商量一下了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "684e8936e9e4c00950f29c78a078a378ca8d39f7fd30353cb9d91088d6e463db", "ja": "{$P$}、着替え終わったよー！\n今日の撮影、楽しみだねっ☆", "zh": "{$P$}，我换好衣服啦！\n今天的拍摄，很期待呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "41ab8506d17011ede7d0397b86283ff2345a8ed8ce0e4c5a38410da93161fe87", "ja": "私がアイスで、オレンジジュースに\n飛び込むシーンなんでしょ？　ワクワクする～っ！", "zh": "我扮成冰块，跳进橙汁里的那场戏对吧？好期待哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e2255c6dcd76da9e14a59847aaffe7b9e026fdd9e502fd07d60afb86b1993f8d", "ja": "ああ。実際にはそんなセット用意できないから、\n飛び込む瞬間を撮影して合成するんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯。实际上没法准备那样的布景，所以要拍摄跳进去的瞬间再进行合成，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5703a3cb5956a816148e4fcc83e63c5dcebb61e3e985fdab5dab117c98598082", "ja": "今見てみたら、ジャンプ台からクッションまでの\n高低差が、結構あるみたいなんだ。", "zh": "我刚才看了一下，跳台到缓冲垫之间的高度差好像还挺大的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "5b74783be20f7b5e89afd57732e5e63d0ea8472627cac82e337cf335a77188b2", "ja": "そうなんだ、楽しそう！\n迫力のあるポスターが撮れそうだね☆", "zh": "这样啊，听起来很有意思！\n感觉能拍出很有冲击力的海报呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a4b40fb613b0a16443f3ba372041c7571c2154590da6e359941a8466c85bf8a3", "ja": "た、楽しそう……いや、難易度の高い撮影になりそう\nだから、監督と相談しようかと思ってたんだけど。", "zh": "看、好像很有意思……不，感觉会是难度很高的拍摄。\n所以我本来想和导演商量一下的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "dd34b39f7f357f6baf049f8f17f9dbcc571b209134fb426096a7398cb3721717", "ja": "えー！　{$P$}、私ならできるよ？\nそれに、安全は確認してくれてるんでしょ？", "zh": "诶——！{$P$}，换作我的话肯定能做到哦？\n而且，你已经确认过安全问题了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1008_p", "source_sha256": "37d00a95b65d260c7f907f5271a1b2950544f0035ccb022ee8aca1b3488f0de1", "ja": "もちろん、スタッフさんが実際にやってくれてる。\nけど海美はアイドルだし、あまり危ない事は……。", "zh": "当然，工作人员确实亲自试过了。\n但海美毕竟是偶像，太危险的事还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "0149eed2dfe8924debd31d809e6bb163a2e70b922a654d1083626d5df88eabf2", "ja": "{$P$}……えへへっ。\n私のこと、心配してくれてありがとーっ！", "zh": "{$P$}……嘿嘿。\n谢谢你担心我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "d124f8c37daf5379adde5f43b6a3b025211c84087bf6a1f1667577448b82e062", "ja": "でも私、こういう時のために鍛えてるから！\nボルダリングも得意だし！", "zh": "不过，我可是为了这种时候才锻炼的！\n而且我还擅长抱石呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "4259514cb8562cb7fe67009efda9b47c4dec2ca7912774c444292773009464f8", "ja": "だから、やらせて！　体幹にも自信あるし、大丈夫！\nしっかりかわいい笑顔で撮ってもらうから☆", "zh": "所以，让我来吧！我的核心力量也很有自信，没问题的！\n我会好好拍出可爱的笑容的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b639953bb2bb380eb733f68c465b8ac72c71c128799badc5ec57f58baf0578ee", "ja": "（身体能力の高い海美でも、難しい撮影だ。……けど、\n海美の可能性を狭めるような選択が、正しいのか……）", "zh": "（就连身体能力出众的海美，也很难完成这种拍摄。……可是，选择限制海美可能性的做法，真的正确吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1013_p", "source_sha256": "48be1888920060150c90ba0a66b8247db023ae98b39dd58b98e08ab7787eba5a", "ja": "……わかった、海美を信じよう！\nその代わり、無理だと思ったらすぐに言う事！", "zh": "……好，我相信海美！\n作为交换，一旦觉得勉强就要马上说出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "fb267a0e27f1f9f071c5846f2c375d8a9a4577670673be8d88bb511a142db16b", "ja": "うん、わかった！　{$P$}に\n心配掛けるようなことはしないから、安心して！", "zh": "嗯，知道啦！我不会做让{$P$}担心的事，所以放心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "4cca1f47cf72b5906cc1ca35790b9345c87c8fd62571f9e669bff3d0e556ff65", "ja": "それじゃあ私、行ってくるね！\nよーし、飛っぶぞ～！！", "zh": "那我出发啦！\n好——要跳咯～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a8c4574593e95cb350d042b54844e6c3bd656aa47613c6a4452ef7132c1d1f62", "ja": "（そうして撮影は始まった。心配していた\n飛び込みも、海美は何なくこなしてしまった……）", "zh": "（就这样，拍摄开始了。之前担心的跳水，海美也轻轻松松地完成了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "a628f8ea1baf670f191f609000d014b995e61121cac3c98be6ee9cb1981d48c1", "ja": "あははは！　飛び込むの、たのしー！\nクッションふっかふか！　もっと飛びたーい！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈！跳下去真好玩——！\n垫子软绵绵的！还想再跳一次——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0214_1018_p", "source_sha256": "dd8b893fb5bd45f242ba660cd23950a67c1fafdd18d90cf4dbbf9bda49ccbdd8", "ja": "（……海美のフィジカル、やっぱりすごいな！\nこれはいいポスターになりそうだぞ……！）", "zh": "（……海美的身体素质果然很厉害啊！这一定能拍出很棒的海报……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
